{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>By me, adoni.</b> It is an expression of entreaty and supplication — in Aramaic, בַּיָּא בַּיָּא (Yevamot 97:, Sanhedrin 64.)." "<b>Yered yerednu.</b> It is a descent for us — we were accustomed to provide for others; now we are in need of you (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:21.512552013Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}